From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sven Panne <sven.panne@checkmk.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 08:50:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(lint): report the changes of the formatting rules to
 always run

--format always runs IndentationClosingBraces and IndentationComments,
which exist only in npm-groovy-lint. Linting never reported them, so a
file could pass linting with the format configuration although --format
changed it.

If these rules are enabled in the configuration, linting now reports
the lines which they change when --format applies them to a file
without other violations. Like --format, this ignores disable comments.

Rules which exist only in npm-groovy-lint are no longer passed to
CodeNarc, which rejects them as unknown.
